{"id": "t105-041", "text": "Kenji - did the Great North Swim last sat. got cramp halfway, had to stop and get pulled out by the safety kayak. bit embarrassed, didn't want to talk abt it much. his sister Keisha said he'd been training for months. wants to try again next yr. ask him abt it gently, maybe next wk over coffee - he only drinks decaf now", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kenji", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Great North Swim", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last sat", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "bit embarrassed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Keisha", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to try again", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next yr"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him abt it gently", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "maybe next wk", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "only drinks decaf", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
