{"id": "t105-045", "text": "Fatima's 40th - 15 March. dinner @ the Lebanese place on Oxford Rd, she loves halloumi + anything w/ pomegranate. no alcohol, mocktails for her. her husband Santiago organising, surprise for the guests not her. card + flowers the day before, don't forget. maybe a cookbook as a gift - she mentioned the Ottolenghi one", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fatima", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "40th", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "15 March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner @ the Lebanese place on Oxford Rd", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "halloumi", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "pomegranate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "no alcohol", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "mocktails", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Santiago", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "card + flowers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "a cookbook as a gift", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "mentioned the Ottolenghi one", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
