{"id": "t105-056", "text": "Eva - the swim meet was today, regionals. came 2nd in 100m back! 0.3s off 1st. her coach says nationals maybe in the spring if she keeps it up. she's starving after every session, eats like 4 bananas. her mum was in tears. text her congrats tonight and ask when nationals is", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "swim meet", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "coach", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nationals", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "maybe in the spring", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in tears", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her congrats", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask when nationals is", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
